msgstr "未指定の場合はプライマリカラーが適用されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2202
msgid "Basic size of rounded corners"
msgstr "角丸の基本サイズ"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2215
msgid ""
"Applies to the rounded corners of buttons, cards, and time slots on the "
"booking page. Set to 0 for square corners (no rounding)."
msgstr ""
"予約ページのボタン・カード・時間枠などの角丸に反映されます。0 を指定すると角"
"丸無し（直角）になります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2220
#: src/admin/class-setup-notices.php:734
msgid "Shift auto registration"
msgstr "シフトの自動登録"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2231
msgid "Up to next month"
msgstr "翌月まで"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2234
msgid "Up to 2 months ahead"
msgstr "2ヶ月先まで"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2237
msgid "Up to 3 months ahead"
msgstr "3ヶ月先まで"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2241
msgid ""
"At the time of saving, and then once a day after that, shifts are "
"automatically registered as published (not draft) for each registered staff "
"member, for any month without a registered shift, from the current month "
"through the selected month ahead, using the same logic as bulk shift "
"registration."
msgstr ""
"保存時と、その後は毎日1回、今月から選択した月までのうち、シフトが登録されてい"
"ない月を、シフトの一括登録と同じ処理でスタッフごとに公開状態（下書きではな"
"い）で自動登録します。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2244
msgid ""
"A shift in the trash still counts as registered and is not re-created, but "
"permanently deleting it will cause that month to be registered again the "
"next time this runs."
msgstr ""
"ゴミ箱にあるシフトは登録済みとして扱われ、再作成されません。ただし完全に削除"
"すると、その月は次回実行時に再び登録されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2249
msgid "Email debug"
msgstr "メールデバッグ"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2258
msgid "Enable email log"
msgstr "メールログを有効にする"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2261
msgid ""
"When enabled, the Email Log page becomes available and email send attempts "
"are recorded."
msgstr ""
"有効にすると、メールログページが利用可能になり、メール送信の試行が記録されま"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2267
msgid "Email log retention period"
msgstr "メールログ送信保存期間"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2281
msgid "Logs older than this will be automatically deleted."
msgstr "指定日数を過ぎたログは自動的に削除されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2291
msgid ""
"Even after registering as a new user, the user does not receive a "
"confirmation email."
msgstr "新規ユーザー登録してもユーザーに確認メールが届きません"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2294
msgid ""
"To authenticate the email sender and prevent tampering, emails that do not "
"have DKIM settings on the server may not even reach the spam folder."
msgstr ""
"送信者認証と改ざん防止のため、サーバーに DKIM 設定がないメールは迷惑メール"
"フォルダに届かないことがあります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2295
msgid "Especially if the user's email address is gmail, it will not arrive."
msgstr "特にユーザーのメールアドレスが gmail の場合は届きません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2297
msgid "Please check the following with the site administrator."
msgstr "サイト管理者に以下の事を確認してください。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2299
msgid ""
"Is DKIM configured on the server side for the domain where this system is "
"running?"
msgstr ""
"このシステムが動いているドメインについて、サーバー側でDKIM設定がされている"
"か？"

