#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:132
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:639
msgid ""
"When bookings sharing the same time slot reach this number, the session is "
"treated as confirmed."
msgstr ""
"同じ時間枠の予約人数の合計がこの人数に達すると、開催決定とみなされます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:133
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:640
msgid "Enter 0 to disable the minimum and accept any number of bookings."
msgstr "0 を入力すると最少催行人数を無効にし、何件でも予約を受け付けます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:134
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:641
msgid "Values above the time slot capacity are reduced to that capacity."
msgstr "予約枠の定員を超える値は、その定員に切り詰められます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:135
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:634
msgid ""
"This menu uses staff nomination, so each booking becomes a private booking "
"for one group."
msgstr "このメニューは指名を使うため、1件の予約は1組の貸切になります。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:136
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:635
msgid ""
"If the number of guests is below this value, the reservation cannot be "
"accepted."
msgstr "申込人数がこの人数に満たない場合、その予約は受け付けられません。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:137
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:636
msgid "Enter 0 to remove the minimum and accept bookings from 1 guest."
msgstr "0 を入力すると人数の下限を設けず、1名からでも予約を受け付けます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:138
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:637
msgid ""
"Values above the time slot capacity (the maximum guests per group) are "
"reduced to that capacity."
msgstr ""
"予約枠の定員（1組の最大人数）を超える値は、その定員に切り詰められます。"

